  "notes": "Flat slab 5.00 x 4.50 x 0.012 m: a 12 x 6 top grid at z = 0.012, the same grid at z = 0 and a rim, 360 triangles.  Six 0.8333 m stripes by face-centre x, alternating cream and brick red, so the weave is colour only - no texture, UV or vertex colour.  The top plane is flat to the last vertex because the ball has to rest on it; the 0.06 m greybox pad and its 0.8 m / 7.5% apron stay terrain and are deliberately not part of the cloth.  Catalog real length is 12 m (the big variant), so the build warns once against that column - this is the 5.0 m map variant.",
